{"header":{"numFound":2346,"maxScore":17.305756,"queryTime":1192,"page":1,"pageSize":10},"results":[{"authors":null,"openAccessColor":"gold","publiclyFunded":false,"eoscIfGuidelines":null,"type":"publication","language":{"code":"und","label":"Undetermined"},"countries":null,"subjects":[{"subject":{"scheme":"FOS","value":"03 medical and health sciences"},"provenance":null},{"subject":{"scheme":"FOS","value":"0302 clinical medicine"},"provenance":null}],"mainTitle":"ОСОБЛИВОСТІ ПРОЗАПАЛЬНИХ ЦИТОКІНІВ (IL-6 І TNF-α) У ДІТЕЙ ІЗ COVID-19","subTitle":null,"descriptions":["<jats:p>Мета дослідження – оцінити показники IL-6 та TNF-α у дітей із COVID-19 та їх залежність від ступеня тяжкості захворювання.  Матеріали та методи. Обстежено 112 дітей із COVID-19 віком від 1 місяця до 18 років, які перебували на стаціонарному лікуванні в інфекційному відділенні Тернопільської міської дитячої лікарні. Рівень IL-6 і TNF-α у зразках сироватки крові визначали методом імуноферментного аналізу з використанням стандартних наборів (BT Lab, Китай).  Результати дослідження та їх обговорення. Середній вік дітей становив (7,04±5,75) років (95 % ДІ 5,96−8,12). За ступенем тяжкості захворювання: 57 дітей (42,23 %) – із легким перебігом захворювання, 43 дітей (31,86 %) – із COVID-19 середньої тяжкості, 12 дітей (8,88 %) – із тяжким перебігом. Концентрація IL-6 у дітей із легким COVID-19 становила 80,36 нг/мл;  при середньотяжкому ступені – 101 нг/мл; а при тяжкому – 151,90 нг/мл (р&lt;0,001). Рівень TNF-α: при легкому ступені тяжкості COVID-19 – 56,7 нг/мл; 97,73 нг/мл при середньому ступені тяжкості та 182,42 нг/мл – при тяжкому ступені (р&lt;0,001).  Висновки. Рівень цитокінів IL-6 та TNF-α у дітей із COVID-19 залежить від ступеня тяжкості захворювання. Пацієнти з тяжким перебігом COVID-19 мають достовірно вищі показники IL-6 і TNF-α порівняно з легким та середньої тяжкості  COVID-19. У дітей із COVID-19 виявлено корелятивні зв’язки між високими показниками IL-6, TNF-α та С-реактивного білка, ШОЕ, лімфоцитів. Не виявлено гендерних закономірностей щодо цитокінів (IL-6, TNF-α) та вікових особливостей щодо показників TNF-α.</jats:p>"],"publicationDate":"2024-04-15","publisher":"Ternopil State Medical University","embargoEndDate":null,"sources":["Crossref"],"formats":null,"contributors":null,"coverages":null,"bestAccessRight":{"code":"c_abf2","label":"OPEN","scheme":"http://vocabularies.coar-repositories.org/documentation/access_rights/"},"container":{"name":"Актуальні питання педіатрії, акушерства та гінекології","issnPrinted":"2411-4944","issnOnline":"2415-301X","issnLinking":null,"ep":"92","iss":null,"sp":"87","vol":null,"edition":null,"conferencePlace":null,"conferenceDate":null},"documentationUrls":null,"codeRepositoryUrl":null,"programmingLanguage":null,"contactPeople":null,"contactGroups":null,"tools":null,"size":null,"version":null,"geoLocations":null,"id":"doi_________::c095643be5497463e43c6d8979b5f43e","originalIds":["10.11603/24116-4944.2024.1.14755","50|doiboost____|c095643be5497463e43c6d8979b5f43e"],"pids":[{"scheme":"doi","value":"10.11603/24116-4944.2024.1.14755"}],"dateOfCollection":null,"lastUpdateTimeStamp":null,"indicators":{"citationImpact":{"citationCount":1.0,"influence":2.2471158E-9,"popularity":2.6067526E-9,"impulse":1.0,"citationClass":"C5","influenceClass":"C5","impulseClass":"C5","popularityClass":"C5"}},"projects":null,"organizations":null,"communities":[{"code":"covid-19","label":"Corona Virus Disease","provenance":null}],"collectedFrom":[{"key":"openaire____::081b82f96300b6a6e3d282bad31cb6e2","value":"Crossref"}],"instances":[{"pids":[{"scheme":"doi","value":"10.11603/24116-4944.2024.1.14755"}],"license":"CC BY","accessRight":{"code":"c_abf2","label":"OPEN","scheme":"http://vocabularies.coar-repositories.org/documentation/access_rights/","openAccessRoute":"gold"},"type":"Article","urls":["https://doi.org/10.11603/24116-4944.2024.1.14755"],"publicationDate":"2024-04-15","refereed":"peerReviewed","hostedBy":{"key":"doajarticles::d817d733b649f2cebbbc8c897491453d","value":"Актуальні питання педіатрії, акушерства та гінекології"},"collectedFrom":{"key":"openaire____::081b82f96300b6a6e3d282bad31cb6e2","value":"Crossref"}}],"links":null,"otherTitles":null,"inDiamondJournal":false,"green":false,"isGreen":false,"isInDiamondJournal":false},{"authors":[{"id":"orcid_______::e1912b5e904fcdd3e502092d842538c0","fullName":"Mansour Salesi","name":"Mansour","surname":"Salesi","rank":1,"pid":{"id":{"scheme":"orcid","value":"0000-0001-7108-6188"},"provenance":null}},{"id":null,"fullName":"Behrokh Shojaie","name":"Behrokh","surname":"Shojaie","rank":2,"pid":null},{"id":null,"fullName":"Ziba Farajzadegan","name":"Ziba","surname":"Farajzadegan","rank":3,"pid":{"id":{"scheme":"orcid_pending","value":"0000-0001-8548-2843"},"provenance":null}},{"id":null,"fullName":"Naghmeh Salesi","name":"Naghmeh","surname":"Salesi","rank":4,"pid":null},{"id":null,"fullName":"Erfan Mohammadi","name":"Erfan","surname":"Mohammadi","rank":5,"pid":null}],"openAccessColor":"gold","publiclyFunded":false,"eoscIfGuidelines":null,"type":"publication","language":{"code":"eng","label":"English"},"countries":null,"subjects":[{"subject":{"scheme":"FOS","value":"03 medical and health sciences"},"provenance":null},{"subject":{"scheme":"FOS","value":"0302 clinical medicine"},"provenance":null},{"subject":{"scheme":"keyword","value":"Original Research"},"provenance":null},{"subject":{"scheme":"SDG","value":"3. Good health"},"provenance":null}],"mainTitle":"TNF-α Blockers Showed Prophylactic Effects in Preventing COVID-19 in Patients with Rheumatoid Arthritis and Seronegative Spondyloarthropathies: A Case–Control Study","subTitle":null,"descriptions":["The interaction between angiotensin-converting enzyme 2 (ACE2) and SARS-CoV-2 is a crucial factor in the viral infections leading to the release of inflammatory proteins, such as TNF-α. Thus, it is hypothesized that TNF-α blockers can prevent either COVID-19 incidence or its serious symptoms. TNF-α blockers are prescribed to treat various autoimmune disorders, including rheumatoid arthritis (RA) and seronegative spondyloarthropathies (SpA). Therefore, the objective of this work was to examine this hypothesis that TNF-α blockers can prevent COVID-19 incidence in patients with RA or SpA.A case-control study was conducted through interviews based on a structured questionnaire to investigate the frequency of COVID-19 incidence in 254 eligible patients with RA or SpA about whom 45% were under treatment with one type of TNF-α blockers including infliximab, adalimumab, and etanercept at least for 3 months during the COVID-19 pandemic. Interviews were carried out twice, at the beginning and the end of the study (June-December 2020). Patients with COVID-19 during the study or before that were considered as cases. The control group was patients without COVID-19 experience. Data were analyzed using descriptive statistics, and logistic regression was used to determine the relationships between COVID-19 incidence and independent variables.A small percentage of patients treated with TNF-α blockers (5.22%, 6/115) experienced COVID-19, while a large percentage of patients with COVID-19 did not receive TNF-α blockers (27.34%, 38/139). According to odds ratio, adalimumab, infliximab, and etanercept decreased significantly the risk of developing COVID-19 up to 96.8, 95, and 80.3% (p < 0.05), respectively. Therefore, TNF-α blockers could probably decrease the chances of the COVID-19 incidence in patients with RA or SpA.A direct and positive correlation between the use of TNF-α blockers and a reduction in the incidence of COVID-19 could suggest the prophylactic role of these drugs in preventing COVID-19 in patients with RA and SpA."],"publicationDate":"2021-07-23","publisher":"Springer Science and Business Media LLC","embargoEndDate":null,"sources":["Crossref","Rheumatol Ther"],"formats":null,"contributors":null,"coverages":null,"bestAccessRight":{"code":"c_abf2","label":"OPEN","scheme":"http://vocabularies.coar-repositories.org/documentation/access_rights/"},"container":{"name":"Rheumatology and Therapy","issnPrinted":"2198-6576","issnOnline":"2198-6584","issnLinking":null,"ep":"1370","iss":null,"sp":"1355","vol":"8","edition":null,"conferencePlace":null,"conferenceDate":null},"documentationUrls":null,"codeRepositoryUrl":null,"programmingLanguage":null,"contactPeople":null,"contactGroups":null,"tools":null,"size":null,"version":null,"geoLocations":null,"id":"doi_dedup___::250577b6809c5adc27e9f47ce97bf7b0","originalIds":["342","10.1007/s40744-021-00342-8","50|doiboost____|250577b6809c5adc27e9f47ce97bf7b0","od_______267::ee5ed3ec64ca584b4e55b65436d8b919","34297311","PMC8299175","34316436","50|od_______267::ee5ed3ec64ca584b4e55b65436d8b919","oai:pubmedcentral.nih.gov:8299175","3184464863"],"pids":[{"scheme":"doi","value":"10.1007/s40744-021-00342-8"},{"scheme":"pmid","value":"34297311"},{"scheme":"pmc","value":"PMC8299175"},{"scheme":"pmid","value":"34316436"}],"dateOfCollection":null,"lastUpdateTimeStamp":null,"indicators":{"citationImpact":{"citationCount":23.0,"influence":2.8077993E-9,"popularity":1.6623943E-8,"impulse":18.0,"citationClass":"C4","influenceClass":"C4","impulseClass":"C4","popularityClass":"C4"}},"projects":null,"organizations":[{"legalName":"Isfahan University of Medical Sciences","acronym":"IUMS","id":"openorgs____::001cc971e8750b358c8ab4f0f5d9f2bd","pids":[{"scheme":"fundref","value":"501100003970"},{"scheme":"wikidata","value":"Q6079799"},{"scheme":"OrgRef","value":"3984826"},{"scheme":"Wikidata","value":"Q6079799"},{"scheme":"FundRef","value":"501100003970"},{"scheme":"mag_id","value":"114982161"},{"scheme":"GRID","value":"grid.411036.1"},{"scheme":"ISNI","value":"000000011498685X"},{"scheme":"ROR","value":"https://ror.org/04waqzz56"}],"countries":[{"code":"IR","label":"Iran (Islamic Republic of)"}],"websiteurl":"http://www.mui.ac.ir/"},{"legalName":"Islamic Azad University, Isfahan","acronym":"Islamic Azad University, Isfahan","id":"openorgs____::3ee4a61318c8da5bcbd64d29afeb0d90","pids":[{"scheme":"GRID","value":"grid.411757.1"},{"scheme":"OrgRef","value":"39431442"},{"scheme":"wikidata","value":"Q5963217"},{"scheme":"Wikidata","value":"Q5963217"},{"scheme":"ISNI","value":"0000000417555416"},{"scheme":"fundref","value":"501100009384"},{"scheme":"ROR","value":"https://ror.org/039zhhm92"},{"scheme":"mag_id","value":"2799282979"},{"scheme":"FundRef","value":"501100009384"}],"countries":[{"code":"IR","label":"Iran (Islamic Republic of)"}],"websiteurl":"http://www.khuisf.ac.ir/"},{"legalName":"Islamic Azad University Mahshahr","acronym":"MHRIAU","id":"openorgs____::1bd410cf758fe5448fc3f33c59677bd9","pids":[{"scheme":"ROR","value":"https://ror.org/01y361889"},{"scheme":"GRID","value":"grid.460822.a"},{"scheme":"ISNI","value":"0000000085405912"},{"scheme":"mag_id","value":"189748745"},{"scheme":"GRID","value":"grid.472320.0"},{"scheme":"Wikidata","value":"Q20110165"},{"scheme":"OrgRef","value":"24945174"},{"scheme":"ROR","value":"https://ror.org/04q7e9e16"}],"countries":[{"code":"IR","label":"Iran (Islamic Republic of)"}],"websiteurl":"http://www.mhriau.ac.ir/Homepage.aspx?lang=en-Us&site=MahshahrUniversity&tabid=1"},{"legalName":"ISLAMIC AZAD UNIVERSITY","acronym":"ISLAMIC AZAD UNIVERSITY","id":"pending_org_::b83d40f65cd124f2dfa0e3494d4b9cab","pids":[{"scheme":"PIC","value":"923227862"}],"countries":[{"code":"IR","label":"Iran (Islamic Republic of)"}],"websiteurl":"http://iausdj.ac.ir/default.aspx"}],"communities":[{"code":"covid-19","label":"Corona Virus Disease","provenance":null}],"collectedFrom":[{"key":"openaire____::8ac8380272269217cb09a928c8caa993","value":"UnpayWall"},{"key":"openaire____::081b82f96300b6a6e3d282bad31cb6e2","value":"Crossref"},{"key":"openaire____::5f532a3fc4f1ea403f37070f59a7a53a","value":"Microsoft Academic Graph"},{"key":"opendoar____::8b6dd7db9af49e67306feb59a8bdc52c","value":"Europe PubMed Central"},{"key":"opendoar____::eda80a3d5b344bc40f3bc04f65b7a357","value":"PubMed Central"}],"instances":[{"pids":[{"scheme":"doi","value":"10.1007/s40744-021-00342-8"}],"license":"CC BY NC","accessRight":{"code":"c_abf2","label":"OPEN","scheme":"http://vocabularies.coar-repositories.org/documentation/access_rights/","openAccessRoute":"gold"},"type":"Article","urls":["https://doi.org/10.1007/s40744-021-00342-8"],"publicationDate":"2021-07-23","refereed":"peerReviewed","hostedBy":{"key":"doajarticles::484739b56ccef892d0478d3ad69d310d","value":"Rheumatology and Therapy"},"collectedFrom":{"key":"openaire____::081b82f96300b6a6e3d282bad31cb6e2","value":"Crossref"}},{"pids":[{"scheme":"doi","value":"10.1007/s40744-021-00342-8"}],"license":"CC BY NC","accessRight":{"code":"c_abf2","label":"OPEN","scheme":"http://vocabularies.coar-repositories.org/documentation/access_rights/","openAccessRoute":"gold"},"type":"Article","urls":["https://link.springer.com/content/pdf/10.1007/s40744-021-00342-8.pdf"],"refereed":"nonPeerReviewed","hostedBy":{"key":"doajarticles::484739b56ccef892d0478d3ad69d310d","value":"Rheumatology and Therapy"},"collectedFrom":{"key":"openaire____::8ac8380272269217cb09a928c8caa993","value":"UnpayWall"}},{"pids":[{"scheme":"pmid","value":"34297311"},{"scheme":"pmc","value":"PMC8299175"}],"alternateIdentifiers":[{"scheme":"doi","value":"10.1007/s40744-021-00342-8"}],"type":"Article","urls":["https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/34297311"],"refereed":"nonPeerReviewed","hostedBy":{"key":"openaire____::55045bd2a65019fd8e6741a755395c8c","value":"Unknown Repository"},"collectedFrom":{"key":"opendoar____::8b6dd7db9af49e67306feb59a8bdc52c","value":"Europe PubMed Central"}},{"pids":[{"scheme":"pmid","value":"34316436"}],"alternateIdentifiers":[{"scheme":"doi","value":"10.1007/s40744-021-00342-8"}],"type":"Article","urls":["https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/34316436"],"refereed":"nonPeerReviewed","hostedBy":{"key":"openaire____::55045bd2a65019fd8e6741a755395c8c","value":"Unknown Repository"},"collectedFrom":{"key":"opendoar____::8b6dd7db9af49e67306feb59a8bdc52c","value":"Europe PubMed Central"}},{"alternateIdentifiers":[{"scheme":"doi","value":"10.1007/s40744-021-00342-8"}],"license":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/Open Access This article is licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International License, which permits any non-commercial use, sharing, adaptation, distribution and reproduction in any medium or format, as long as you give appropriate credit to the original author(s) and the source, provide a link to the Creative Commons licence, and indicate if changes were made. The images or other third party material in this article are included in the article's Creative Commons licence, unless indicated otherwise in a credit line to the material. If material is not included in the article's Creative Commons licence and your intended use is not permitted by statutory regulation or exceeds the permitted use, you will need to obtain permission directly from the copyright holder. To view a copy of this licence, visit http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/ (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/) .","accessRight":{"code":"c_abf2","label":"OPEN","scheme":"http://vocabularies.coar-repositories.org/documentation/access_rights/","openAccessRoute":null},"type":"Article","urls":["http://dx.doi.org/10.1007/s40744-021-00342-8"],"publicationDate":"2021-07-23","refereed":"nonPeerReviewed","hostedBy":{"key":"opendoar____::eda80a3d5b344bc40f3bc04f65b7a357","value":"PubMed Central"},"collectedFrom":{"key":"opendoar____::eda80a3d5b344bc40f3bc04f65b7a357","value":"PubMed Central"}},{"alternateIdentifiers":[{"scheme":"doi","value":"10.1007/s40744-021-00342-8"},{"scheme":"mag_id","value":"3184464863"}],"type":"Other literature type","urls":["https://dx.doi.org/10.1007/s40744-021-00342-8"],"refereed":"nonPeerReviewed","hostedBy":{"key":"openaire____::55045bd2a65019fd8e6741a755395c8c","value":"Unknown Repository"},"collectedFrom":{"key":"openaire____::5f532a3fc4f1ea403f37070f59a7a53a","value":"Microsoft Academic Graph"}},{"alternateIdentifiers":[{"scheme":"mag_id","value":"3184464863"},{"scheme":"doi","value":"10.1007/s40744-021-00342-8"}],"type":"Other literature type","urls":["https://dx.doi.org/10.1007/s40744-021-00342-8"],"refereed":"nonPeerReviewed","hostedBy":{"key":"openaire____::55045bd2a65019fd8e6741a755395c8c","value":"Unknown Repository"},"collectedFrom":{"key":"openaire____::5f532a3fc4f1ea403f37070f59a7a53a","value":"Microsoft Academic Graph"}}],"links":[],"otherTitles":null,"inDiamondJournal":false,"green":true,"isGreen":true,"isInDiamondJournal":false},{"authors":[{"id":"orcid_______::08aec9f1c7500a89f17a9ce638afda8b","fullName":"Zarina Mohd Zawawi","name":"Zarina","surname":"Mohd Zawawi","rank":1,"pid":{"id":{"scheme":"orcid","value":"0000-0001-5727-7359"},"provenance":null}},{"id":null,"fullName":"Jeevanathan Kalyanasundram","name":"Jeevanathan","surname":"Kalyanasundram","rank":2,"pid":null},{"id":null,"fullName":"Rozainanee Mohd Zain","name":"Rozainanee","surname":"Mohd Zain","rank":3,"pid":null},{"id":null,"fullName":"Ravindran Thayan","name":"Ravindran","surname":"Thayan","rank":4,"pid":null},{"id":null,"fullName":"Dayang Fredalina Basri","name":"Dayang Fredalina","surname":"Basri","rank":5,"pid":null},{"id":"orcid_______::1f0decffdef9c9492876bafba8a2a1a7","fullName":"Wei Boon Yap","name":"Wei Boon","surname":"Yap","rank":6,"pid":{"id":{"scheme":"orcid","value":"0000-0003-2449-8395"},"provenance":null}}],"openAccessColor":"gold","publiclyFunded":false,"eoscIfGuidelines":null,"type":"publication","language":{"code":"eng","label":"English"},"countries":null,"subjects":[{"subject":{"scheme":"keyword","value":"Inflammation"},"provenance":null},{"subject":{"scheme":"FOS","value":"03 medical and health sciences"},"provenance":null},{"subject":{"scheme":"FOS","value":"0302 clinical medicine"},"provenance":null},{"subject":{"scheme":"keyword","value":"SARS-CoV-2"},"provenance":null},{"subject":{"scheme":"keyword","value":"Tumor Necrosis Factor-alpha"},"provenance":null},{"subject":{"scheme":"keyword","value":"Humans"},"provenance":null},{"subject":{"scheme":"keyword","value":"COVID-19"},"provenance":null},{"subject":{"scheme":"keyword","value":"Cytokines"},"provenance":null},{"subject":{"scheme":"keyword","value":"Tumor Necrosis Factor Inhibitors"},"provenance":null},{"subject":{"scheme":"keyword","value":"Review"},"provenance":null}],"mainTitle":"Prospective Roles of Tumor Necrosis Factor-Alpha (TNF-α) in COVID-19: Prognosis, Therapeutic and Management","subTitle":null,"descriptions":["<jats:p>The coronavirus disease 2019 (COVID-19) became a worldwide concern at the beginning of 2020 and has affected millions. Several previous studies revealed the impact of the imbalanced innate immune response on the progression of COVID-19 and its disease outcomes. High levels of proinflammatory cytokines such as tumor necrosis factor-alpha (TNF-α) and interleukins are produced readily by innate immune cells to fight Severe Acute Respiratory Syndrome-Coronavirus-2 (SARS-CoV-2) infections. Nonetheless, cytokine-mediated inflammatory events are also linked to detrimental lung injury and respiratory failure, which can result in deaths among COVID-19 patients. TNF-α is amongst the early cytokines produced to mediate proinflammatory responses and enhance immune cell infiltration in response to SARS-CoV-2 infections. In COVID-19, TNF-α-mediated inflammation can cause detrimental tissue damage and gradually promotes lung fibrosis, which later results in pneumonia, pulmonary edema, and acute respiratory distress syndrome. This review, therefore, aims to deliberate the immunomodulatory roles of TNF-α in promoting inflammation and its relation with COVID-19 morbidity and mortality. In addition, this review also proposes the potential of TNF-α as a biomarker for the prognosis of severe COVID-19 and its related complications and as a molecular target for anti-TNF-α therapy.</jats:p>"],"publicationDate":"2023-03-24","publisher":"MDPI AG","embargoEndDate":null,"sources":["Crossref","Int J Mol Sci"],"formats":null,"contributors":null,"coverages":null,"bestAccessRight":{"code":"c_abf2","label":"OPEN","scheme":"http://vocabularies.coar-repositories.org/documentation/access_rights/"},"container":{"name":"International Journal of Molecular Sciences","issnPrinted":null,"issnOnline":"1422-0067","issnLinking":null,"ep":null,"iss":null,"sp":"6142","vol":"24","edition":null,"conferencePlace":null,"conferenceDate":null},"documentationUrls":null,"codeRepositoryUrl":null,"programmingLanguage":null,"contactPeople":null,"contactGroups":null,"tools":null,"size":null,"version":null,"geoLocations":null,"id":"doi_dedup___::801d77ba046a310a79bd6c94c49a4a10","originalIds":["ijms24076142","10.3390/ijms24076142","50|doiboost____|801d77ba046a310a79bd6c94c49a4a10","od_______267::3f634a3e436bc8a15625db27cba06b62","37047115","PMC10094668","50|od_______267::3f634a3e436bc8a15625db27cba06b62","oai:pubmedcentral.nih.gov:10094668"],"pids":[{"scheme":"doi","value":"10.3390/ijms24076142"},{"scheme":"pmid","value":"37047115"},{"scheme":"pmc","value":"PMC10094668"}],"dateOfCollection":null,"lastUpdateTimeStamp":null,"indicators":{"citationImpact":{"citationCount":91.0,"influence":4.2617843E-9,"popularity":6.01327E-8,"impulse":91.0,"citationClass":"C4","influenceClass":"C4","impulseClass":"C3","popularityClass":"C3"}},"projects":null,"organizations":[{"legalName":"Ministry of Health","acronym":"Ministry of Health","id":"openorgs____::18e475e8130b4f037c678c17b802bd93","pids":[{"scheme":"GRID","value":"grid.414596.b"},{"scheme":"fundref","value":"501100006506"},{"scheme":"wikidata","value":"Q6867090"},{"scheme":"OrgRef","value":"27703587"},{"scheme":"Wikidata","value":"Q6867090"},{"scheme":"ISNI","value":"0000000406029808"},{"scheme":"FundRef","value":"501100006506"},{"scheme":"ROR","value":"https://ror.org/02y7p0749"}],"countries":[{"code":"BR","label":"Brazil"}],"websiteurl":"http://portalsaude.saude.gov.br/i